#ASSERT NOT isWD (Date 7 4 2026)
#ASSERT isWD (Date 8 4 2026)
#ASSERT NOT isWD (Date 27 4 2026)
#ASSERT NOT isWD (Date 6 2 2026)
#ASSERT NOT isWD (Date 8 2 2027)
#ASSERT NOT isWD (Date 24 12 2026)
