#ASSERT earliestT `the landlord` `periodic` `s 51(2)(a) the owner or family will live there` (Date 2 3 2026) `personally` EQUALS JUST (Date 13 4 2026)
#ASSERT earliestT `the tenant` `periodic` `s 51(2A) the tenant, in any case` (Date 2 3 2026) `personally` EQUALS JUST (Date 23 3 2026)
-- C04-C10 deemed service
