#ASSERT earliestT `the landlord` `periodic` `s 51(2)(a) the owner or family will live there` (Date 9 7 2026) `by email or other electronic address, after 5 pm` EQUALS JUST (Date 24 8 2026)
#ASSERT earliestT `the landlord` `periodic` `s 51(1) the landlord, in any case` (Date 4 9 2026) `by post` EQUALS JUST (Date 9 12 2026)
#ASSERT earliestT `the tenant` `periodic` `s 51(2A) the tenant, in any case` (Date 22 10 2026) `by post` EQUALS JUST (Date 19 11 2026)
#ASSERT earliestT `the tenant` `periodic` `s 51(2A) the tenant, in any case` (Date 22 12 2026) `by delivery to a mailbox or door` EQUALS JUST (Date 25 1 2027)
